Octoscript ships a compatibility core derived from Makepad. It is consumed as
the `makepad-script` git dependency pinned in `crates/octoscript-core/Cargo.toml`
and `crates/octoscript-capabilities/Cargo.toml`, taken from the `octoscript`
branch of https://github.com/OctoSense-org/makepad.

Upstream project: https://github.com/makepad/makepad
Original import revision: 4f9ce7a8bb3fd19e5c61dcf13edd2e6d4a04cefc
Shipped paths: platform/script and the leaf dependencies it pulls under libs/.
